# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Cloudflare already serves HTTPS and can force it in the dashboard under
# SSL/TLS, Edge Certificates, Always Use HTTPS. That switch is the real fix
# for the HTTPS item on the SEO list and it cannot be set from the repo.
#
# What this file does handle is one canonical hostname, so www and apex do not
# compete as two copies of the same site.

https://www.kwikfatcut.com/*  https://kwikfatcut.com/:splat  301!
